{"steam_appid":3582120,"steam_name":"Cohen 1939","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3582120/1978464346/7f2dec839969c24c143e5f976552caea3f36e0d0/1790736379/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790737208","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257440487/0d6a5d8e1b3ef9ae0431a312410a1abd9351fb4d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790737208","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/f691dbe8bb99bd6eb9d94b29eeda055bbe2f9900/ss_f691dbe8bb99bd6eb9d94b29eeda055bbe2f9900.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790737209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/ee2ffa6f3cbf6d8175d28abd54840ec217467643/ss_ee2ffa6f3cbf6d8175d28abd54840ec217467643.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790737209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/7a20b1c7ee553fd33ce73802002e75ae36b06630/ss_7a20b1c7ee553fd33ce73802002e75ae36b06630.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790737209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/a66478c980ee5b1aa55e4be9c35e8d4645e11f5e/ss_a66478c980ee5b1aa55e4be9c35e8d4645e11f5e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790737209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/bc63e89331de534ecbfc21b9ca98ac334f68e44f/ss_bc63e89331de534ecbfc21b9ca98ac334f68e44f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790737209"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enter Birmingham’s criminal underworld as Elisa seeks revenge for her murdered husband. Cohen 1939 pairs Peaky Blinders-inspired gangster atmosphere with the lethal top-down combat of Hotline Miami. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/790b26e7bfe49a6e6082fcafbc3fea60.avif?t=1790737209\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies die fast. So do you. Read their positions, choose your moment, and strike before they can react. Every encounter puts your aim, movement, and judgement to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/b6b5cdadae222ea25dbba1333b249dbd.poster.avif?t=1790737209\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/b6b5cdadae222ea25dbba1333b249dbd.webm?t=1790737209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/b6b5cdadae222ea25dbba1333b249dbd.mp4?t=1790737209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/e2c148e2b39fd2170b09c2e58b7e379a.avif?t=1790737209\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun an enemy with your empty gun, grab a fresh weapon, and keep moving. Chain gunfire, throws, and melee attacks to turn a desperate fight around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four playable characters bring different abilities to the fight, from sliding shots and focused fire to raven summons and rage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/0eddb014d5f46ab4cdc0a0be42eacefc.poster.avif?t=1790737209\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/0eddb014d5f46ab4cdc0a0be42eacefc.webm?t=1790737209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/0eddb014d5f46ab4cdc0a0be42eacefc.mp4?t=1790737209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/f2f99a75231be48c81041b8f6500979f.avif?t=1790737209\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach from a blind spot or make noise to draw enemies towards you. Choose where the fight begins—and who goes down first. A careful approach can give you the opening you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/f9cee442623edad26352866285f6da4c.poster.avif?t=1790737209\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/f9cee442623edad26352866285f6da4c.webm?t=1790737209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/f9cee442623edad26352866285f6da4c.mp4?t=1790737209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/99e5df5beab400eb6281728683b14606.avif?t=1790737209\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain-soaked streets, smoke-filled hideouts, and sharply dressed gangsters set the scene for a bloody reckoning. Follow Elisa into a world of betrayal as she hunts those responsible for her husband’s death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/875963b14f97d219cf0c6b4189a1d9cb.poster.avif?t=1790737209\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/875963b14f97d219cf0c6b4189a1d9cb.webm?t=1790737209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/875963b14f97d219cf0c6b4189a1d9cb.mp4?t=1790737209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or later</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Cube of Cube"],"publishers":["2P Games"],"release_date":"29 Sep, 2026"}